+## Unresolved optional review: whole-component cancellation
+
+A bounded new rival exposes a teaching gap in the current source
+`55f725bfacf1db458e29cb59c5b3e3cf30367a9a7f8e339c280aad2e9ca52356`, selected rule
+`1ed249363e20`. Treat each half as a binary occupancy mask, reflect the left,
+and cancel an entire four-connected component whenever any of its cells overlaps
+the other half. Paint only wholly unmatched components on the right. This
+objectwise interpretation is plausible for sparse folded shapes but differs from
+the authoritative cellwise occupancy XOR.
+
+For seed **18**, **medium** difficulty, generated sample indices **0 and 1**
+are two demonstrations fitting both rules, while sample **2** is a query on
+which they disagree. All three inputs pass `self_check`; the existing
+`lesson_identifiable` returns no reasons because this rival is not declared.
+Protected Racket independently executed both programs on all three inputs
+(six evaluations) and confirmed the exact recorded labels. The bounded search
+examined 56 lessons and stopped at this first counterexample.
+
+Reproduce from the packet root:
+
+```sh
+WORK/.venv/bin/python review.py run python3 generators/9a1459fe40d0/workspace/probe_optional.py
+```
+
+The complete two-demo/one-query witness, both programs, source/rule hashes,
+runtime identity, command and limits are in
+`counterexamples/optional-component-cancellation.json`; the runnable bounded probe is
+`workspace/probe_optional.py`. This finding remains **unresolved**. A focused
+future repair should teach partial overlap within a connected occupied shape,
+so cellwise cancellation is demonstrated before such a query, and add this
+objectwise rival to the finite teaching check. Production code was left
+unchanged. No full battery, universal uniqueness claim, owner acceptance or
+training admission is implied. The earlier no-issue assessment remains limited
+to its previously tested rivals.
